    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb two-bedroom mid-terrace home with an attractive façade, brimming with refurbishment potential.\r\n\r\nThis charming property features an attractive brick-faced exterior and opens into a spacious living area, enjoying ornate coving, understairs storage and a fireplace.We then move into the kitchen, enjoying ample cupboard space and splashback tiling. From the kitchen, there is access to the spacious dining area and potential home office and garden, making this an ideal place to relax and entertain. The fully tiled family bathroom is also located on the ground floor. The accommodation is completed by two spacious bedrooms upstairs.\r\n\r\n15 Warrenmount enjoys an excellent and highly convenient location. With a fantastic selection of cafés, bars and restaurants all within easy reach, as well as Grafton Street, Trinity College, TU Dublin, St. James's Hospital and The Coombe all nearby. The area is also well served by public transport, with frequent bus routes and the nearby LUAS providing easy access to the city centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nGFCH \r\nSunny Garden \r\nSought after location \r\nRenovation potential\r\nOrnate coving \r\nUnderstairs storage \r\nPermit parking"
      },
